o;s 4 grids. June to July came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 47% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December at 50%. Grid 16382 had its driest year in 2007 at 58%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 77.5.</p>"}
